# --- Binary media -----------------------------------------------------------
# widgets/ and gadgets/ are shared UI assets consumed by nebulacast.com,
# stellar-attractor, and other products. Rendered/binary media lives on the
# CDN, not in git. Vector/text formats (svg, and text-based data like csv/
# json/yml) are NOT listed here — they're diffable and fine to keep in git.

# Images (raster)
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.bmp
*.tiff
*.tif
*.webp
*.heic
*.heif
*.ico
*.psd
*.xcf

